AUDIO: 'system. Here\'s the part we\'re proud of. Unlock the hinge and the whole thing comes out. After some thought, we enlarged XL.'

[16:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '[music] Size for size\'s sake wasn\'t enough in our opinion. So, we made it so it can connect with SNM models, the same way you attach two S models to an L. But XL had more to offer than just being'

[17:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'bigger. So, we turned it into a sustainer, too. Now, every height, every width, every size has a sustainer. 65 sustainers, 65 drawers, 130 units total.'

